<section class="sg-sec" id="inspired"><h2>What it inspired</h2><ul class="sg-chain"><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Freedom is Coming: Songs of Protest and Praise from South Africa (Anders Nyberg)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1984</span><span class="sg-chain-h">four-voice arrangement, songbook and recording</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Gather Comprehensive (GIA Publications)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1994</span><span class="sg-chain-h">English translation, as &quot;We Are Marching in the Light of God&quot;</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">The New Century Hymnal (United Church of Christ)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1995</span><span class="sg-chain-h">English translation, same title</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Community of Christ Sings</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">2002</span><span class="sg-chain-h">included in the hymnal</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Singing the Journey (Unitarian Universalist Association)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">2005</span><span class="sg-chain-h">included in the supplement</span></li></ul></section>
<section class="sg-sec" id="inspired-by"><h2>What it drew on</h2><ul class="sg-chain"><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Methodist or Pentecostal hymnody</span><span class="sg-chain-h">the words may draw on it</span></li></ul></section>
